Contact Us .pd-contact-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .pd-contact-card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
            padding: 40px 36px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 560px;
            border-top: 4px solid #e74c3c;
        }
        .pd-contact-card h2 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .pd-contact-card p.subtitle {
            color: #6b7280;
            margin: 0 0 28px;
            font-size: 0.97rem;
        }
        .pd-cf-field {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .pd-cf-field label {
            display: block;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #374151;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }
        .pd-cf-field input,
        .pd-cf-field textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 11px 14px;
            border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.97rem;
            color: #1f2937;
            background: #fafafa;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: inherit;
        }
        .pd-cf-field input:focus,
        .pd-cf-field textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #3498db;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(52,152,219,0.13);
            background: #fff;
        }
        .pd-cf-field textarea {
            height: 130px;
            resize: vertical;
        }
        .pd-cf-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 13px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c, #c0392b);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            font-family: inherit;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }
        .pd-cf-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c0392b, #a93226);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(231,76,60,0.3);
        }
        .pd-cf-success {
            background: #ecfdf5;
            border: 1.5px solid #6ee7b7;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            color: #065f46;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .pd-cf-errors {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1.5px solid #fca5a5;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            color: #991b1b;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            font-size: 0.93rem;
        }
        .pd-cf-errors ul { margin: 6px 0 0 16px; padding: 0; }
        .pd-cf-errors li { margin-bottom: 4px; } Contact Us Have questions or need more details on peptide dosages? Fill out the form below, and we'll be in touch soon. Your Name Your Email Your Message Loading security check... Leave this field empty Send Message

